    "description": "<h3>PaaS - Pizzas as a Service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUsing your username, name, and email address, deliver pizza(s) to any address specified on the order form.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Prerequisite Installation:</strong>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n        <li>SSH into the CloudBolt server and switch to the root user: <code>sudo su -</code></li>\r\n    <li>Install usaddress: <code>pip install usaddress</code></li>\r\n    <li>Go to proserv dir: <code>cd /var/opt/cloudbolt/proserv/</code></li>\r\n    <li>Clone pizzapi: <code>git clone https://github.com/gamagori/pizzapi.git</code></li>\r\n    <li>Once the installation is complete, click <strong>Order</strong> to place your pizza order.</li>\r\n</ol>",
